  "checkout steps"
 ],
 "teaches": [
  "Call {\"Steps\": {\"steps\": [\"Ordered\", \"Shipped\", \"Out for delivery\", \"Delivered\"], \"current\": \"@stage\"}}: the labels are a static list, current a 0-based index the app sets (steps before it are done, after it to do)",
  "Horizontal (the default) fills its parent's width with the dots evenly spaced and the labels under them; orientation vertical stacks the dots with the labels beside them and wraps its content",
  "size sets the dot diameter, showLabels false keeps only the dots, and label overrides the accessibility description (\"Step N of M\" by default)"
 ],
 "snippets": [
  {
   "pointer": "/root/column/children/2",
   "shows": "draw.shapes",
   "note": "bound to the exported variable stage (2): two ticked discs, a haloed current disc, an outlined last one, joined by connectors"
  },
  {
   "pointer": "/root/column/children/2",
   "shows": "data.measure",
   "note": "the canvas reads componentWidth() / n as the pitch between dots, so the row follows its parent's width"
  },
  {
   "pointer": "/root/column/children/4",
   "shows": "a11y.labels",
   "note": "a literal current (1) with 18 dp dots and an explicit accessibility label"
  },
  {
   "pointer": "/root/column/children/6",
   "shows": "layout.state",
   "note": "vertical, all three done but the last: each label is a muted and an onSurface copy swapped by visibility"
  }
 ],
