  "describe": "Under the title and 'Order #4821', four dots across the width: Ordered and Shipped are blue discs with a white tick joined by a blue line, Out for delivery a blue disc with a pale blue halo and a bold dark label, Delivered a grey outlined disc on a grey line; setting stage to 3 ticks the third and fills the fourth. Below, 'Checkout' over a smaller four-step row at its second step (Cart ticked, Address haloed), then 'History' over a vertical column of three dots with Ordered and Packed ticked and Shipped haloed. Mono draws done as white discs with a black tick, current as a ring with a dot inside, to do as a grey ring (black on white in mono light). At 234 dp the four-step rows keep four dots that shrink slightly and 'Out for delivery' wraps; at 540 dp the dots spread out.",
